DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com,TAILSCALE
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com,TAILSCALE
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com,TAILSCALE
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com,TAILSCALE

# > Claude
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai,TAILSCALE
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,TAILSCALE

# > Microsoft Copilot
